   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NORFOLK (Oct. 6, 2017) The shipâ€™s bell stands at the brow of the Virginia-class attack submarine Pre-Commissioning Unit (PCU) Washington (SSN 787) prior to the boatâ€™s commissioning ceremony, Oct. 7. Washington is the U.S. Navyâ€™s 14th Virginia-class attack submarine and the fourth U.S. Navy ship named for the state of Washington. (U.S. Navy photo by Chief Mass Communication Specialist Darryl I. Wood/Released)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
