    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:rights>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">PENSACOLA, Fla., (April 10, 2015) â€“ Electronics Technician 2nd Class Jeffrey Thomas, from Navy Recruiting Orientation Unit (NORU) Pensacola, observes Centennial High School (Las Vegas) Navy Junior Reserve Officers Training Corps (NJROTC) Cadet Delmonte Williams performing curl-ups during the 2015 Navy Junior ROTC Nationals Academic, Athletic and Drill Championship on Naval Air Station Pensacola, Fla., here, April 10. Sailors from (NORU) judged the curl-up and push-up portions of the competition. (U.S. Navy photo by Scott A. Thornbloom/Released)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
